## STEP 4 — Create screenshots folder
```
swiftcart-admin/assets/screenshots/
```

Take screenshots of each page and save them as:
```
dashboard.png
products.png
orders.png
users.png
categories.png
banners.png
banner.png   ← the banner image
```

---

## STEP 5 — Open PowerShell inside swiftcart-admin
```
1. Open File Explorer
2. Navigate to your swiftcart-admin folder
3. Click the address bar
4. Type: powershell
5. Press Enter